t-to-know-about-the-planned-explosion-in-iowa.html'&gt;关于爱荷华州米德尔敦计划爆炸的了解&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：What to Know About the Planned Explosion in Middletown, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/climate/what-to-know-about-the-planned-explosion-in-iowa.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</link><description>美国股市周二下跌，回吐了前一交易日因黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官而引发的部分大幅上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html'&gt;随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq declines as Nvidia slides, giving back part of Monday’s rally: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:10:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 特朗普对英伟达的推动显示了公司在全球经济战争中的重要性</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/economy/trump-nvidia-national-security-us-economics.html</link><description>在他之前的历届总统都曾在国家危机时期救助过企业。特朗普走得更远：他把美国的命运押在了一位受青睐的首席执行官身上。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/economy/trump-nvidia-national-security-us-economics.html'&gt;特朗普对英伟达的推动显示了公司在全球经济战争中的重要性&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump’s Nvidia Push Shows Companies’ Importance in Global Economic War&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/economy/trump-nvidia-national-security-us-economics.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:11:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 地中海饮食背后的科学家如何陷入特朗普对哈佛的战争</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html</link><description>沃尔特·威利特（Walter Willett）研究饮食与健康之间的联系，这是卫生部长小罗伯特·F·肯尼迪（Robert F. Kennedy Jr.）的首要任务。无论如何，他的拨款都被冻结了。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html'&gt;地中海饮食背后的科学家如何陷入特朗普对哈佛的战争&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How a Scientist Behind the Mediterranean Diet Got Caught in Trump’s War on Harvard&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/us/politics/walter-willett-trump-harvard.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:21:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等2家] 专栏：特朗普对英伟达董事会的干预让国家安全付出了代价。我们的对手会注意到</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html</link><description>特朗普总统决定迫使英伟达董事会重新任命黄仁勋担任首席执行官，这正是北京、德黑兰和莫斯科希望看到的。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html'&gt;专栏：特朗普对英伟达董事会的干预让国家安全付出了代价。我们的对手会注意到&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Op-ed: Trump’s Nvidia board intervention put a price on national security. Our adversaries will take note&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html'&gt;随着黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官，特朗普实际上凌驾于英伟达董事会之上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：With Jensen Huang’s Return as C.E.O., Trump Effectively Overrode Nvidia’s Board&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:23:58 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>